       "## Sentinel-2 Level 2A Surface Reflectance\n",
       "\n",
       "<div class=\"row\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-around\"><div class=\"column\"><div class=\"badge-row\">[![User guide](https://img.shields.io/badge/-User_guide-77cc09)](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/s2-processing#S2Processing-L2AAlgorithmsS2-Processing-L2A-Algorithmstrue){target='_blank'}[![Catalog API:STAC](https://img.shields.io/badge/-Catalog_API:STAC-77cc09?style=flat)\n",
